  "description": {
    "de": "In this appendix, an overview is given of the 18 cities and regions that were chosen for the indepth  analysis in chapter 5 of the main report. This overview includes a short description of the  cities themselves, meteorological and climatic situation, and air quality (with emphasis on the  pollutants and years for which a plan had to be drawn up). A summary of the cities’ plans and  programmes as well as transport plans (where available) is given as well."
  },
